# Opening Image (p.1)

EXT. ABANDONED SLAUGHTERHOUSE - NIGHT
= Jenny breaks in. The carcass screams.
[[BD Drones: Spotlight drone, night flight // licensed pilot]]
[[BD Fog & Haze: Hazer + low fog machine]]
[[BD Animatronics: Screaming pig carcass // servo jaw + bellows]]
[[BD Props: Rusted meat hooks x12]]

Rain. A drone hums overhead, its spotlight sweeping rusted hooks.

JENNY
(into phone)
I'm inside. It's so quiet.

BUTCHER (O.S.)
Not for long.

Fog rolls across the killing floor. A pig carcass on a hook twitches. Then it SCREAMS.

CUT TO:

INT. MEAT LOCKER - CONTINUOUS
= The Butcher takes Jenny.
[[BD Special Makeup FX: Throat slash appliance @JENNY // 3 repeats]]
[[BD Blood & Gore: Arterial spray rig, 2L @JENNY // pump behind plastic]]
[[BD Wounds & Continuity: Throat wound - fresh @JENNY // carry to sc 7]]
[[BD Weapons: Cleaver (soft hero + hard) @BUTCHER]]

Jenny backs into the cold. The cleaver comes out of the dark.

Her throat opens in a hot red spray across the frosted plastic.

